  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healing and Reconciliation: Support to Societal Healing, Victim Care and Resilience Post-May 2023 Mass Shootings in Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The majority of development services envisaged under this Agreement relate to support the healing process at societal and victim level after the mass shootings in May 2023. The services that will be provided by UNDP include set-up and administration of the Coordination Body, expert support for the establishment of a victim support mechanism, support for the annual commemorative event(s), support for planning of the memorial(s), and support for the establishment of a systemic integrated response</narrative>
  </description>
